<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said it has launched 120 million American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$146.00    PREMIUM	 16.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.00	GEARING	 13.4X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  06.OCT.97    PAYDATE	 01.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  4,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$134.00</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
